      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "We sincerely apologize for the cold food and rude service, and we are immediately reviewing our kitchen and staff training protocols to ensure this never happens again. Your experience does not reflect our high standards, and we are committed to making this right by offering a complimentary full breakfast for you and your party upon your next visit. We value your feedback deeply and hope you will give us another chance to serve you with the warmth and care you deserve.",
